1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,933
Blockchain and AI

2
00:00:00,933 --> 00:00:01,967
are coming together,

3
00:00:01,967 --> 00:00:02,833
industries are merging.

4
00:00:02,833 --> 00:00:03,433
Where do you see

5
00:00:03,433 --> 00:00:04,367
as being the bottlenecks?

6
00:00:04,367 --> 00:00:05,800
It's all about verified data.

7
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,700
AI is in

8
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,033
very sandboxed environments.

9
00:00:08,033 --> 00:00:09,267
You go to ChatGPT.com

10
00:00:09,267 --> 00:00:10,933
and nothing really leaves there.

11
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:11,767
Recently we've seen things

12
00:00:11,767 --> 00:00:13,333
like OpenCloth, where AI

13
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:14,267
sort of interacts outside

14
00:00:14,267 --> 00:00:15,667
of these sandbox environments.

15
00:00:15,667 --> 00:00:16,633
Things start going wrong.

16
00:00:16,633 --> 00:00:17,333
People start attacking

17
00:00:17,333 --> 00:00:18,633
your specific agent.

18
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:19,333
The question we start

19
00:00:19,333 --> 00:00:20,367
asking is, how can we

20
00:00:20,367 --> 00:00:21,300
verify where this data

21
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,000
was trained on?

22
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:22,833
Because there is now

23
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:23,833
a very real incentive

24
00:00:23,833 --> 00:00:25,667
to start sending bad data

25
00:00:25,667 --> 00:00:26,367
to, let's say,

26
00:00:26,367 --> 00:00:27,633
your competitors, or to

27
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:28,267
other nation states,

28
00:00:28,267 --> 00:00:29,233
and try to influence

29
00:00:29,233 --> 00:00:29,800
the decisions that

30
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,633
their AI makes.

